roduces acrylamide liquids and acrylamide powders under the BRILMIDE brand; n-methylol acrylamide (NMA) under the BRILMER NMA brand; and fabrics and made ups for industrial applications. Further, it operates two windmills in Rajasthan and Gujarat. The company serves the agrochemicals, pharmaceuticals, dyestuffs, petrochemicals, perfumeries, polymers, textiles, rubber, ceramics, water treatment, specialty chemicals, and other industrial sectors. It exports its products to Japan, Korea, the United States, and China. The company was formerly known as Asia Fab Ltd and changed its name to Black Rose Industries Limited in September 2006. The company was incorporated in 1990 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India. Black Rose Industries Limited operates as a subsidiary of Wedgewood Holdings Ltd.","employees":79,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1788307200,"asOf":1795774495},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774494,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Black Rose Industries\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Black Rose Industries (NSEI:BLACKROSE) - Stock Analysis","s":"Simply Wall St","d":1795707508,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxPRWpiZFBWNV82N1JsaVFfYVNzaXl6OWd5SGluSUFwZGhlZGRDM01XU3R3TEpVaEVLQ0xuUEd1WWk2SFZKdTJOZVdNRXpkQkdtWV9xYmY5bi1jaldNSHlKeXpWakM5S1B0OHV0VmFsT2k0aHVvVkF4c2QyZTc1SVpKMDNlVklyTXZ3WlVIUHZ5dXpWZw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Bombay High Court Quashes EPF Appellate Tribunal's Remand Order for Lack of Reasons in Damages Assessment Under Section 14-B of EPF Act. Tribunal directed to decide appeal afresh with reasoned order after considering Supreme Court precedents.","s":"Lawtext","d":1795161600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE1UMHNTc21IbEJjRW1kdGFsSlVwTWh5ZmlON001WWZhLUFrOU5KdGNPSS0xeV9Wa3NSNHpFbkNsa1FMVGI3T2NMTDVNcEZ5b0tkSFB5MDZIX1d4XzZTZzRwd3FKMXlVdw?oc=5","g":["ord","legal"]},{"t":"Why Black Rose Industries' (NSE:BLACKROSE) Earnings Are Better Than